{"unit_id":"iambbp__dsh-monitor#card-zh","repo":"iambbp/dsh-monitor","commit":"6347483804c29450dd152d5fa6657b371f9db5cb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-monitor 是面向 DSH Web 的 DeepSeek 用量监控插件，在服务端监听会话事件并把统计展示在页面悬浮窗中。它累计输入、输出和缓存命中 Token，按事件时刻及北京时区峰谷规则估算费用，并统计每日交互次数。数据通过本地 API 提供给每两秒刷新的面板，面板可拖动、折叠、隐藏并复制今日报告；每日数据保存并滚存历史。适合希望在 DSH 页面查看 DeepSeek 用量、费用和配额进度的用户。可配置配额上限，默认值为 10 元；无需额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:234-311","lib/ui.js:11-28"]}
{"unit_id":"iambbp__dsh-monitor#card-en","repo":"iambbp/dsh-monitor","commit":"6347483804c29450dd152d5fa6657b371f9db5cb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-monitor tracks DeepSeek usage in DSH Web. It totals tokens, estimates cost by Beijing peak and off-peak periods, and counts turns. A local API feeds a floating panel for viewing and copying reports. Statistics persist locally with daily rollover. Quota defaults to 10 CNY; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:234-311","lib/ui.js:11-28"]}
